<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 11 bln levs 3-mth discount T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 11 bln levs 3-mth discount T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer 11 billion levs of three-month discount T-bills with no minimum acceptable price set in advance at an auction on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	   BG3036897000</p>
<p> Maturity		 three months</p>
<p> Par value		11 bln levs</p>
<p> Auction date	   June 2</p>
<p> Issue date	     June 4</p>
<p> Maturity date	  September 3</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
